/P 57 0 R
/E ( A single-core Xtensa LX7 part that drops Bluetooth entirely to focus on Wi-Fi-only, cost- and power-sensitive applications. Its standout feature is native USB On-The-Go \(OTG\), letting it act as a USB host or device without an external bridge chip.)
