/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 57 0 R
/E ( Dual-core Xtensa LX7 at 240 MHz, with Bluetooth \(BLE 5.0\) restored alongside Wi-Fi 4, plus native USB OTG and vector instructions that accelerate AI/ML inference \(e.g., wake-word detection, image classification\). This combination has made the S3 the flagship choice for new AIoT designs.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
